Continue through implementation, asset integration, testing, fixing failures, authorized publishing, and verification of the actual live result. A plan, generated asset, passing partial test, commit, or deployment submission is not completion.

Give brief progress updates while continuing. Do not ask “shall I continue?” or end your turn with actionable work outstanding. Resolve routine decisions yourself, preserve other contributors’ changes, and do not expand the scope unnecessarily.

